@startuml
actor User
participant "Faircado UI (popup.html)" as UI
participant "Faircado Data Control (data-control.html)" as DC
participant "Content Script (content.js)" as CS
participant "Injected Script (navigation-events.js)" as IS
participant "Web Accessible Resource (save.js)" as WAR
participant "Service Worker (background.js)" as SW
box "Faircado Backend"
  participant "Faircado Web App" as WA
  participant "Faircado Catalogue" as FC
  participant "CMS API" as CMS
  participant "Catalog Service API" as CSA
  participant "Mixpanel" as MP
end box

cloud "Third-Party oEmbed Providers" as OE {
}

rectangle "External Websites (e.g., Amazon, Google, Ecosia)" as EW

User -> UI: Opens popup
UI -> SW: sendMessage(init)
SW --> UI: Auth Data

User -> DC: Clicks uninstall/activate
DC -> SW: browser.management.uninstallSelf() / localStorage.setItem(ACTIVATED)
DC -> FC: Redirect (after-extension-install-versioned, extension-to-website-onboarding)

EW -> IS: Inject navigation-events.js (by CS)
IS -> CS: window.postMessage(url_change_event)
CS -> SW: chrome.runtime.sendMessage (GetHeuristicData, isSupportedWebsite, error, mixpanel)
SW -> CMS: fetch(IS_PRODUCT_PAGE_HEURISTIC_API, EXTENSION_AB_TESTS_API, EXTENSION_CONFIG_API, SUPPORTED_WEBSITES_API)
SW -> CSA: fetch(IS_SUPPORTED_WEBSITE_API)
SW -> MP: POST /track, /engage (events, user profile)

CS -> WA: window.postMessage(messageTypes.setAuth, messageTypes.openOnFullMode, messageTypes.setFilter)
WA -> CS: window.postMessage(messageTypes.webAppReady, messageTypes.hasResult, messageTypes.closeExtension, messageTypes.setToExtensionStorage)
CS -> SW: chrome.runtime.sendMessage(messages from WA)

EW -> CS: DOM Mutation / Resize events
CS -> CS: extractPageContent (selectors, metadata)
CS -> FC: Redirection (handleRedirectToCatalogue with pageData)
CS -> SW: chrome.runtime.sendMessage(mixpanel - EXPERIMENT, pageData)

CS -> WAR: iframe.src = addQueryToUrl(WEB_APP_ADDRESS, {...})
WAR -> CS: window.parent.postMessage({imgUrl, imgData})

CS -> SW: chrome.runtime.sendMessage(InternalMessageTypes.GetMachineKey, InternalMessageTypes.GetAbTestsConfig, InternalMessageTypes.GetExtensionConfig, InternalMessageTypes.IsActivated, SetItemToSessionStorage, GetItemFromSessionStorage, RemoveItemFromSessionStorage, ClearDataFromSessionStorage)

CS -> OE: (Potential interaction via htmlmetaparser for oEmbed discovery if implemented)

@enduml
